{
  "id": 323558134,
  "iid": 16991,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Websocket: use `FT_BYTES` for payloads",
  "description": "`doc/README.dissector` says `FT_NONE` is for fields which don't have a\nvalue. Replace our use of `FT_NONE` in the websocket dissector with\n`FT_BYTES` (and `BASE_NO_DISPLAY_VALUE` so the GUI rendering is\nunchanged) since the payload is, technically, a value.\n\nMain use case for this change is for extracting the payload using\n`tshark -T fields`, so the payload fields give their hex content instead\nof just the number 1.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-08-27T16:30:40.941Z",
