          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Have you tried `tshark -T fields -E @websocket.payload`?\n\nNot that it's necessarily a reason not to do this, but that will show the raw bytes of any field, including `FT_NONE` and `FT_PROTOCOL`. It also works for columns. New for 4.4, mentioned in the release notes.",
